# Score B: our own blind reading of the pre-1931 print at its URL, so public domain. Read 2026-11-07, used only to compare, never served.
# The print repeats the first line (repeat sign); it is written out here, so one verse plays in full.
# Score B is a blind second reading of Schäublin, Kinderlieder für Schule und Haus, Basel 1899, p. 77, No. 113.
# The BSB scan is marked for non-commercial use; the 1899 notes are public domain and are only compared, never served.
